{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：00:18 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：00:18 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：00:18 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"日本千葉縣東北部5.4級地震　東京震感強烈　無海嘯風險。日本氣象廳網頁截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87b3d5a26f0db8013b23e06aed2c1540/2026-10/2026-10-29_12_13_53.png\"/><p>日本氣象廳表示，當地時間周四（29日）凌晨零時7分（香港時間周二晚上11時7分）左右，日本千葉縣東北部發生5.4級地震，震央位於北緯35.7度、東經140.7度，震源深度約50公里。</p><p>日本氣象廳確認，今次地震不會引發海嘯。東京亦有強烈震感。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:40:47.724729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:40.584293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:38:32.255060+00:00","content_hash":"f0dd1f528f8c506caf5a490c20207b5f43b7e027a8155770698fb8124362345f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}